  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.LocalAudio">Audio stays on this device</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Title">Privacy</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Intro">Meeting audio stays under your control.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Access.Title">What the app accesses</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Access.Description">Recording starts only after you choose Record or confirm a meeting prompt. A recording can include microphone audio and audio played by applications on this device.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Detection.Title">Meeting detection</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Detection.Description">isTranscribe reads audio-session and process information on this device to notice signs of a meeting.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Storage.Title">Storage</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Storage.Description">Recordings, settings, recovery data, and diagnostic logs stay on this device. Recordings remain until you delete or move them.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Network.Title">Network and transcription</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Network.Description">Recordings, settings, and diagnostic logs stay on this device. Cloud transcription sends audio chunks to the service you choose after your explicit action or automatic-transcription consent.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Controls.Title">Your controls</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Privacy.Controls.Description">You decide whether to record. You can pause, finish, or discard a recording and change microphone and startup settings.</x:String>

