  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.OpenRouter.Zdr">Use only routes that do not retain data (ZDR)</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.OpenRouter.Zdr.Description">If a ZDR route is unavailable, you can turn off this setting. OpenRouter can then choose a route governed by the selected provider’s data-retention policy.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Consent.Format">I agree to send audio chunks from my recordings to {0} for transcription. {0} may charge my account under its terms.</x:String>
