  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Automatic.Description">A new recording enters the queue after its audio file is saved.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Automatic.LocalUnavailable">Download and verify the selected model to enable automatic transcription.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Local.Title">On-device transcription</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Local.Description">Audio is processed on this device. Download a speech-to-text model once to get started.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Local.Engine">On this device</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Local.Privacy">Network access is used only to download the model. Audio and transcript text remain on this device.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Local.RecordingNotice">Recording is in progress. On-device transcription will continue after the meeting ends.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Local.Resource.LowPower">Energy saver is on. Automatic transcription starts after it is turned off. A manual start asks for confirmation.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Local.Resource.Memory">There is less free memory than the selected model needs. Choose a smaller model.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Local.Resource.Disk">There is less disk space than the selected model needs. Free some space or choose a smaller model.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.Settings.Local.Resource.Unavailable">Resources for on-device transcription are unavailable. Check Diagnostics, then try again.</x:String>

