  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.LocalModel.Preset.Compact.Description">For lower-powered or older computers. Uses about 388 MB of memory while running.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="String.Transcription.LocalModel.Preset.Balanced.Description">For everyday meetings. Uses about 852 MB of memory while running.</x:String>
